      "prompt": "The Venn diagram shows the number of elements in each region of sets A and B, given in terms of x. There are 49 elements in total. Find the value of x, and hence find the number of elements in both A and B.",
      "solution_steps": [
        "a_only + b_only + both + neither = total: (x) + (2x) + (2x + 5) + 14 = 49",
        "Collecting like terms: 5x + 19 = 49",
        "x = 6",
        "Substituting x = 6: A only = 6, B only = 12, both = 17, neither = 14",
        "The number of elements in both A and B = 17"
